<h2>Plants</h2>
<p class="english">(some noise of Belle fumbling with the microphone?)</p>
<li><p class='igt' id='i0'><span class='words' id='i0w'><span class="word" id="i0w0">Xilegg</span><span class="word" id="i0w1">nixodhiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i0w2">yitots'i,</span><span class="word" id="i0w3">gaghtlghanh</span><span class="word" id="i0w4">xotl'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i0w5">xiɬdik,</span><span class="word" id="i0w6">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i0w7">ngi'in</span><span class="word" id="i0w8">nguqogg</span><span class="word" id="i0w9">xigide'on'</span><span class="word" id="i0w10">ts'ixiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i0w11">tux</span><span class="word" id="i0w12">xiɬdi,</span><span class="word" id="i0w13">gag</span><span class="word" id="i0w14">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i0w15">ninalyayh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i0g'><span class="gloss" id="i0g0">spring</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g1">it's getting to be</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g3">snow melts</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g4">after</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g5">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g6">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g7">out</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g8">on earth</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g9">it's sunnny</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g10">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g11">during</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g12">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g13">berry</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g14">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i0g15">they're growing back</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i0ft'>'In the spring after the snow melts, the berries grow when there's lots of sunshine.'<a href="#n1" class="notelink">1</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i1'><span class='words' id='i1w'><span class="word" id="i1w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i1w1">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i1w2">dandhu'on</span><span class="word" id="i1w3">detthat</span><span class="word" id="i1w4">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i1w5">tr'iniha.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i1g'><span class="gloss" id="i1g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i1g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i1g2">salmonberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i1g3">first</span><span class="gloss" id="i1g4">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i1g5">we pick</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i1ft'>'Then salmonberries are the first thing we pick.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i2'><span class='words' id='i2w'><span class='word' id=i2w0'>'cause</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i2g'></span><span class='trans' id='i2ft'></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i3'><span class='words' id='i3w'><span class="word" id="i3w0">Iy</span><span class="word" id="i3w1">niniɬjikdi</span><span class="word" id="i3w2">xo'in</span><span class="word" id="i3w3">q'ayit</span><span class="word" id="i3w4">dit'anh</span><span class="word" id="i3w5"><em>that</span><span class="word" id="i3w6">dandhu'on.</em></span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i3g'><span class="gloss" id="i3g0">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i3g1">it rots to ground</span><span class="gloss" id="i3g2">because</span><span class="gloss" id="i3g3">right away</span><span class="gloss" id="i3g4">(people) do</span><span class="gloss" id="i3g5"></span><span class="gloss" id="i3g6">salmonberry</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i3ft'>'People do that right away because salmonberries rot to the ground.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i4'><span class='words' id='i4w'><span class="word" id="i4w0">Yitotl'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i4w1">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i4w2">niɬyagh</span><span class="word" id="i4w3">che</span><span class="word" id="i4w4">tr'iniha</span><span class="word" id="i4w5">sanh duxodhil ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i4w6">.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i4g'><span class="gloss" id="i4g0">after that</span><span class="gloss" id="i4g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i4g2">blueberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i4g3">also</span><span class="gloss" id="i4g4">we pick</span><span class="gloss" id="i4g5">during the summer</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i4ft'>'After that we pick blueberries all summer long.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i5'><span class='words' id='i5w'><span class="word" id="i5w0">Xeyts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i5w1">xits'i xodhiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i5w2">xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i5w3">che</span><span class="word" id="i5w4">iy</span><span class="word" id="i5w5">niɬyagh</span><span class="word" id="i5w6">che</span><span class="word" id="i5w7">niɬteyh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i5g'><span class="gloss" id="i5g0">fall</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g1">it's getting to be</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g3">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g4">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g5">blueberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g6">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i5g7">it's overripe</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i5ft'>'When it's getting to be fall the blueberries get soft.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i6'><span class='words' id='i6w'><span class="word" id="i6w0">Axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i6w1">yiggiy</span><span class="word" id="i6w2">dinathdloy</span><span class="word" id="i6w3">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i6w4">tr'iniha.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i6g'><span class="gloss" id="i6g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i6g1">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i6g2">high-bush cranberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i6g3">again and again</span><span class="gloss" id="i6g4">we pick</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i6ft'>'Then we pick high-bush cranberries.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i7'><span class='words' id='i7w'><span class="word" id="i7w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i7w1">nondiniy</span><span class="word" id="i7w2">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i7w3">tr'iniha.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i7g'><span class="gloss" id="i7g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i7g1">red currant</span><span class="gloss" id="i7g2">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i7g3">we pick</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i7ft'>'We pick red currants too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i8'><span class='words' id='i8w'><span class="word" id="i8w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i8w1">dandiggiy</span><span class="word" id="i8w2">che,</span><span class="word" id="i8w3">iy</span><span class="word" id="i8w4">che</span><span class="word" id="i8w5">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i8w6">ngizrenh,</span><span class="word" id="i8w7">dandiggiy.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i8g'><span class="gloss" id="i8g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g1">raspberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g2">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g3">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g4">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g5">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g6">it's good</span><span class="gloss" id="i8g7">raspberry</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i8ft'>'Raspberries are very good too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i9'><span class='words' id='i9w'><span class="word" id="i9w0">Gag veda</span><span class="word" id="i9w1">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i9w2">tr'iniha.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i9g'><span class="gloss" id="i9g0">black currant</span><span class="gloss" id="i9g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i9g2">we pick</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i9ft'>'We pick black currants too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i10'><span class='words' id='i10w'><span class="word" id="i10w0">Iy</span><span class="word" id="i10w1">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i10w2">iy</span><span class="word" id="i10w3">yitr'iɬvatr</span><span class="word" id="i10w4">xineg.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i10g'><span class="gloss" id="i10g0">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g2">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g3">we cook them</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g4">nicely</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i10ft'>'That's good cooked too.'<a href="#n2" class="notelink">2</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i11'><span class='words' id='i11w'><span class="word" id="i11w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i11w1">xiyhdi</span><span class="word" id="i11w2">xonet</span><span class="word" id="i11w3">nontr'alyayh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i11g'><span class="gloss" id="i11g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i11g1">winter</span><span class="gloss" id="i11g2">for</span><span class="gloss" id="i11g3">we keep them</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i11ft'>'We keep them for wintertime.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i12'><span class='words' id='i12w'><span class="word" id="i12w0">Shaxil</span><span class="word" id="i12w1">vitux</span><span class="word" id="i12w2">tr'idriyh</span><span class="word" id="i12w3">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i12w4">yitr'iɬvatr</span><span class="word" id="i12w5">just like</span><span class="word" id="i12w6">gashigh</span><span class="word" id="i12w7">xit'an.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i12g'><span class="gloss" id="i12g0">sugar</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g1">in it</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g2">we sprinkle</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g3">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g4">we cook them</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g5"></span><span class="gloss" id="i12g6">white</span><span class="gloss" id="i12g7">people</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i12ft'>'Sugar is mixed in with them and we cook them just like white people.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i13'><span class='words' id='i13w'><span class="word" id="i13w0">Gilegiq</span><span class="word" id="i13w1">dughot</span><span class="word" id="i13w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i13w3">didinaxi'ne</span><span class="word" id="i13w4">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i13w5">xughot</span><span class="word" id="i13w6">iy</span><span class="word" id="i13w7">tr'iɬvatr.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i13g'><span class="gloss" id="i13g0">book</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g1">according to</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g2">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g3">it tells us</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g4">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g5">according to</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g6">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i13g7">we cook</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i13ft'>'It's written on the (recipe) book and we cook according to that.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i14'><span class='words' id='i14w'><span class="word" id="i14w0">Iy</span><span class="word" id="i14w1">che</span><span class="word" id="i14w2">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i14w3">ngizrenh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i14g'><span class="gloss" id="i14g0">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g2">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g3">it's good</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i14ft'>'That's very good (tasty) too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i15'><span class='words' id='i15w'><span class="word" id="i15w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i15w1">xeyts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i15w2">nuxodhiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i15w3">tux</span><span class="word" id="i15w4">xiɬdik,</span><span class="word" id="i15w5">ngido'</span><span class="word" id="i15w6">Nts'ini'an ghun' deloy</span><span class="word" id="i15w7">ts'itr'itidiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i15g'><span class="gloss" id="i15g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g1">autumn</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g2">it's coming</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g3">when</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g4">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g5">downriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g6">Bonasilla Mt.</span><span class="gloss" id="i15g7">we go to</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i15ft'>'When it was getting to be fall we would go downriver to Bonasilla Mountain.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i16'><span class='words' id='i16w'><span class="word" id="i16w0">Yit xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i16w1">deloy</span><span class="word" id="i16w2">q'idz</span><span class="word" id="i16w3">dixinaɬt'adi</span><span class="word" id="i16w4">sre'</span><span class="word" id="i16w5">tr'inihiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i16g'><span class="gloss" id="i16g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i16g1">mountain</span><span class="gloss" id="i16g2">on</span><span class="gloss" id="i16g3">how many</span><span class="gloss" id="i16g4">I wonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i16g5">we camp</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i16ft'>'I don't know how many nights we camped on the mountain.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i17'><span class='words' id='i17w'><span class="word" id="i17w0">Nenhtl'it</span><span class="word" id="i17w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i17w2">long</span><span class="word" id="i17w3">tr'iniha</span><span class="word" id="i17w4">niɬanht'asr</span><span class="word" id="i17w5">yiɬ,</span><span class="word" id="i17w6">xiyhdi</span><span class="word" id="i17w7">xonet.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i17g'><span class="gloss" id="i17g0">low-bush cranberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g1">really</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g2">lots</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g3">we pick</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g4">blackberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g5">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g6">winter</span><span class="gloss" id="i17g7">for</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i17ft'>'We picked lots of low-bush cranberries and blackberries too for winter.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i18'><span class='words' id='i18w'><span class="word" id="i18w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i18w1">xisrghed</span><span class="word" id="i18w2">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i18w3">tr'iniha,</span><span class="word" id="i18w4">go</span><span class="word" id="i18w5">sanh</span><span class="word" id="i18w6">tux.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i18g'><span class="gloss" id="i18g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g1">rosehips</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g2">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g3">we pick</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g4">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g5">summer</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g6">during</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i18ft'>'We picked rosehips too here during summer.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i19'><span class='words' id='i19w'><span class="word" id="i19w0">Agidet</span><span class="word" id="i19w1">iy</span><span class="word" id="i19w2">vixelan</span><span class="word" id="i19w3">sanh</span><span class="word" id="i19w4">tux.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i19g'><span class="gloss" id="i19g0">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g1">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g2">the ones that are</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g3">summer</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g4">during</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i19ft'>'That's all there is in the summer.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i20'><span class='words' id='i20w'><span class="word" id="i20w0">Getiy</span><span class="word" id="i20w1">iy,</span><span class="word" id="i20w2">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i20w3">ngizrenh,</span><span class="word" id="i20w4">xiyhdi</span><span class="word" id="i20w5">xonet.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i20g'><span class="gloss" id="i20g0">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g1">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g2">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g3">it's nice</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g4">winter</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g5">for</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i20ft'>'It's very nice for winter.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i21'><span class='words' id='i21w'><span class="word" id="i21w0">Go</span><span class="word" id="i21w1">nenhtl'it</span><span class="word" id="i21w2">iy</span><span class="word" id="i21w3">tetth'ok</span><span class="word" id="i21w4">yet</span><span class="word" id="i21w5">tr'iniha</span><span class="word" id="i21w6">ts'i.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i21g'><span class="gloss" id="i21g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i21g1">low-bush cranberry</span><span class="gloss" id="i21g2">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i21g3">basket</span><span class="gloss" id="i21g4">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i21g5">we're picking</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i21ft'>'We picked cranberries in birchbark baskets.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i22'><span class='words' id='i22w'><span class="word" id="i22w0">Tetth'ok</span><span class="word" id="i22w1">chux</span><span class="word" id="i22w2">tux</span><span class="word" id="i22w3">doghnontr'idiniha',</span><span class="word" id="i22w4">sraqay</span><span class="word" id="i22w5">itlanh</span><span class="word" id="i22w6">dong,</span><span class="word" id="i22w7">sidithniqaye.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i22g'><span class="gloss" id="i22g0">basket</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g1">big</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g2">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g3">we fill up picking</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g4">child</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g5">I am</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g6">in the past</span><span class="gloss" id="i22g7">my parents</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i22ft'>'When I was a child, my family and I filled them to the top.'</span></p></li>
