<li><p class='igt' id='i72'><span class='words' id='i72w'><span class="word" id="i72w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i72w1">xo'in</span><span class="word" id="i72w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i72w3">niɬk'otr'ith'izrts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i72g'><span class="gloss" id="i72g0">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i72g1">for</span><span class="gloss" id="i72g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i72g3">we don't go out to middle</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i72ft'>'For that reason we wouldn't go out there any other time.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i73'><span class='words' id='i73w'><span class="word" id="i73w0">Uxuxuyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i73w1">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i73w2">dina'oxo</span><span class="word" id="i73w3">xigalyayh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i73g'><span class="gloss" id="i73g0">suddenly</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g2">for us</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g3">they bring in things</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i73ft'>'Then suddenly they would bring things in for us.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i74'><span class='words' id='i74w'><span class="word" id="i74w0">Axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i74w1">yit</span><span class="word" id="i74w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i74w3">dinatseye</span><span class="word" id="i74w4">engithit</span><span class="word" id="i74w5">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i74w6">q'idh</span><span class="word" id="i74w7">ntr'o'isr.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i74g'><span class="gloss" id="i74g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g3">our grandmothers</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g4">out</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g5">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g6">beside</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g7">we go out</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i74ft'>'Then we would go out dancing (beside) our old grandmas out there.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i75'><span class='words' id='i75w'><span class="word" id="i75w0">&quot;Gila.&quot;</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i75g'><span class="gloss" id="i75g0">go on</span><span class="gloss" id="i75g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i75ft'>&quot;'Hurry. Right now.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i76'><span class='words' id='i76w'><span class="word" id="i76w0">An</span><span class="word" id="i76w1">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i76w2">an</span><span class="word" id="i76w3">dithitl'enath</span><span class="word" id="i76w4">da'</span><span class="word" id="i76w5">xiviniydaɬchith,</span><span class="word" id="i76w6">vitthigits'igh xelan.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i76g'><span class="gloss" id="i76g0">they</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g2">they</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g3">cloth</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g4">parka</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g5">they dressed up in</span><span class="gloss" id="i76g6">hooded parka</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i76ft'>'They too are dressed in cloth overparkas.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i77'><span class='words' id='i77w'><span class="word" id="i77w0">Axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i77w1">yit xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i77w2">giq'i anh</span><span class="word" id="i77w3">dinanoghɬ dixi'ne</span><span class="word" id="i77w4">iy</span><span class="word" id="i77w5">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i77w6">iy</span><span class="word" id="i77w7">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i77w8">tr'iɬzreyh</span><span class="word" id="i77w9">xiq'i.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i77g'><span class="gloss" id="i77g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g2">the masked one</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g3">they're telling us</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g4">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g5">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g6">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g7"></span><span class="gloss" id="i77g8">we're taking</span><span class="gloss" id="i77g9">it looks like</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i77ft'>'They tell us about the mask (dance motion), and then we can do it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i78'><span class='words' id='i78w'><span class="word" id="i78w0">Che</span><span class="word" id="i78w1">idiqat</span><span class="word" id="i78w2">hiy.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i78g'><span class="gloss" id="i78g0">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i78g1">it's bought</span><span class="gloss" id="i78g2">it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i78ft'>'It too (the song) was (already) purchased.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i79'><span class='words' id='i79w'><span class="word" id="i79w0">Yitots'i</span><span class="word" id="i79w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i79w2">xeɬedz</span><span class="word" id="i79w3">dixit'anh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i79g'><span class="gloss" id="i79g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i79g1">really</span><span class="gloss" id="i79g2">well</span><span class="gloss" id="i79g3">they're doing</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i79ft'>'They're having a really good time.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i80'><span class='words' id='i80w'><span class="word" id="i80w0">Axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i80w1">nod</span><span class="word" id="i80w2">xinihiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i80w3">xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i80w4">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i80w5">ngi'egh</span><span class="word" id="i80w6">xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i80w7">q'itr'ididaɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i80g'><span class="gloss" id="i80g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g1">twice</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g2">they spend night</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g4">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g5">outside</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g6">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i80g7">we go around</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i80ft'>'They would spent two nights (in the village) and then we went around outside again.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i81'><span class='words' id='i81w'><span class="word" id="i81w0">Dina'oxoldhidye</span><span class="word" id="i81w1">dina'itoɬxiɬzrisr</span><span class="word" id="i81w2">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i81g'><span class="gloss" id="i81g0">our tea partners</span><span class="gloss" id="i81g1">they give us tea</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i81ft'>'Our tea partners would give us tea.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i82'><span class='words' id='i82w'><span class="word" id="i82w0">Axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i82w1">yitotl'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i82w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i82w3">ton-gataɬdix</span><span class="word" id="i82w4">che.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i82g'><span class="gloss" id="i82g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i82g1">afterwards</span><span class="gloss" id="i82g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i82g3">they do it over again (next night)</span><span class="gloss" id="i82g4">too</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i82ft'>'Then they do would do it again the next night.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i83'><span class='words' id='i83w'><span class="word" id="i83w0">Yit</span><span class="word" id="i83w1">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i83w2">gitr'ixit'an</span><span class="word" id="i83w3">gileg</span><span class="word" id="i83w4">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i83w5">ixidile,</span><span class="word" id="i83w6">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i83w7">iy</span><span class="word" id="i83w8">cheche,</span><span class="word" id="i83w9">iy</span><span class="word" id="i83w10">che</span><span class="word" id="i83w11">niɬk'otr'ith'izrts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i83w12">.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i83g'><span class="gloss" id="i83g0">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g2">native from somewhere</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g3">song</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g4">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g5">they sing</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g6">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g7">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g8">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g9">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g10">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i83g11">we don't go out to the middle</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i83ft'>'They also sang songs from other villages, and we didn't go out to the middle (during that) either.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i84'><span class='words' id='i84w'><span class='word' id=i84w0'>because</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i84g'></span><span class='trans' id='i84ft'></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i85'><span class='words' id='i85w'><span class="word" id="i85w0">Dina---</span><span class="word" id="i85w1">vaxa</span><span class="word" id="i85w2">dina'oqo</span><span class="word" id="i85w3">xidiqat</span><span class="word" id="i85w4">ts'ixiyan'</span><span class="word" id="i85w5">niɬk'otr'ito'isr.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i85g'><span class="gloss" id="i85g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i85g1">with it</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g2">for us</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g3">they pay</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g4">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g5">we will go out to the middle</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i85ft'>'We only went out to the middle when they paid us.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i86'><span class='words' id='i86w'><span class="word" id="i86w0">Ngiyixi</span><span class="word" id="i86w1">xit'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i86w2">xiyan'</span><span class="word" id="i86w3">tr'ididltth'e.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i86g'><span class="gloss" id="i86g0">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g1">underneath</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g2">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g3">we sit</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i86ft'>'We just sat underneath.'<a href="#n9" class="notelink">9</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i87'><span class='words' id='i87w'><span class="word" id="i87w0">Ngiyixi</span><span class="word" id="i87w1">xit'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i87w2">xiyan'</span><span class="word" id="i87w3">tr'ididltth'e.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i87g'><span class="gloss" id="i87g0">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g1">underneath</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g2">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g3">we sit</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i87ft'>'We just sat underneath.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i88'><span class='words' id='i88w'><span class="word" id="i88w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i88w1">xo'in</span><span class="word" id="i88w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i88w3">niɬk'otr'ith'izrts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i88g'><span class="gloss" id="i88g0">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i88g1">for</span><span class="gloss" id="i88g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i88g3">we don't go out to middle</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i88ft'>'So we don't go out to the middle of the floor.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i89'><span class='words' id='i89w'><span class="word" id="i89w0">Ngu'o</span><span class="word" id="i89w1">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i89w2">xidoy</span><span class="word" id="i89w3">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i89w4">ngiyixi</span><span class="word" id="i89w5">ngin</span><span class="word" id="i89w6">tr'idiggisr</span><span class="word" id="i89w7">ts'ixiyan'</span><span class="word" id="i89w8">xiyentr'ididiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i89g'><span class="gloss" id="i89g0">over</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g2">door</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g3">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g4">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g5">floor</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g6">we're crawling</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g7">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g8">we go in</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i89ft'>'We just crawled on the floor from the doorway when we went in the kashim.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i90'><span class='words' id='i90w'><span class="word" id="i90w0">Go dadz</span><span class="word" id="i90w1">dixighaɬchuxdi</span><span class="word" id="i90w2">srisr</span><span class="word" id="i90w3">dhith</span><span class="word" id="i90w4">xididiniɬchedh</span><span class="word" id="i90w5">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i90w6">ngiyixi</span><span class="word" id="i90w7">q'an' t'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i90w8">ngiyigg</span><span class="word" id="i90w9">traɬtth'et.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i90g'><span class="gloss" id="i90g0">this way</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g1">so big</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g2">bear</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g3">skin</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g4">curtain door</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g5">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g6">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g7">?</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g8">inside</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g9">kashim</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i90ft'>'There was a bear skin this big hanging over the door and down inside the kashim.'<a href="#n10" class="notelink">10</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i91'><span class='words' id='i91w'><span class="word" id="i91w0">Q'odet</span><span class="word" id="i91w1">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i91w2">xidondiditey</span><span class="word" id="i91w3">yan'</span><span class="word" id="i91w4">xethdlat.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i91g'><span class="gloss" id="i91g0">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g2">door</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g3">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g4">they have</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i91ft'>'Now they only have a regular door.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i92'><span class='words' id='i92w'><span class="word" id="i92w0">Agidet.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i92g'><span class="gloss" id="i92g0">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i92g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i92ft'>'That's all.'</span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol><li><span class="footnote" id="n1"><em> nguqogg </em> from <em> ngin' qogg</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n2">for example, as jam</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n3"><em> niɬtiy gaga', </em> lit. 'crane's berries'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n4">Belle's younger brothers were Lucius and Wilfred.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n5">Ithchax Xichux, lit. 'big area under evergreen tree'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n6"><em> Dotith xingith 'Long portage, Goblet Ck.'</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n7">kerosene lantern with chimney</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n8">They just sat and watched.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n9">under the bench; bench as wide as the floor</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n10">hair side facing in, skin side out in Shageluk</span></li></ol>
</div>
</div>
